                                "sense_id": "11618ccd-f7b2-34d8-b18f-a79137bdf593",
                                "text": "- Babushka wants you to call the poor little bugger Casimir after her uncle in the Resistance. Can you imagine what would happen in any schoolyard to a kid with a name like Casimir?"
